      "content": "It sounds like you're going through a really difficult period of creative burnout and self-doubt. Feeling like a parody of your former self is incredibly disheartening, but remember that creative phases ebb and flow. Sometimes, stepping away from the pressure to produce something \"perfect\" can allow for new, unexpected inspiration to surface. Be kind to yourself during this struggle; your worth isn't tied to your output.",
